The first app in the world that will improve your weapon skills.  
Various difficulty levels. Practice anytime, anywhere. Pistol and Carbine Training Program

If you have a gun, you need ongoing training not to lose your skills and learn how to shoot better. Finding time for instructor-supervised training in a shooting range is challenging because of the modern life rhythm. We have created Drill - a personal shooting instructor on your smartphone, to solve this problem. Study anywhere, any time convenient for you, in any environment.

Our expert instructors create all exercises with experience gained during many years of practice, participation in sports competitions, and real combat operations. We have collected their unique expertise into the author's exercise programs of various complexity: from basic things to self-defense in conditions of limited visibility for the militiamen, police, athletes, and civilians.

We did our best to make the application as convenient as possible for you. Here are the functions in active development (some of them are already working in the app): 
- all exercises are described step by step in detail for different levels of training; all actions in exercises are voiced. You hear an explanation of what is demonstrated on screen. The Voice assistant directs you and draws your attention to the execution nuances;
- use the training constructor to create your plans, lessons, or courses to meet your personal goals;
- use the progress tracker with the ability to receive feedback from certified instructors right in the app (live feedback);
- keep a shooter diary, and note down all the necessary information received while training;
- download all the content to your smartphone and train offline anytime and anywhere.

A pistol and carbine training program are available in the app, constantly expanding and updating with new drills. We are actively working on launching courses for other firearm types. 

Our goal is to create a multi-platform, a universal tool where you can access extensive specialized information.
